Package: tff2
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Thomas Guettler <guettlimm@thomas-guettler.de>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: udev, systemd
Provides: tff, tff-linux
Conflicts: tff (<< 2.0.0)
Replaces: tff, tff-linux
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/guettli/tff2
Description: Ten Flying Fingers (TFF) Keyboard Remapper
 High-performance userspace and embedded keyboard remapper for Linux evdev
 and Raspberry Pi Pico RP2040. Supports combos, tap-vs-hold, modal layers,
 one-shot modifiers, auto-shift, and home-row mouse keys.
